          "rationale": "It was battlefield tactics."
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "label": "He attacked at night with elephants",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "It was battlefield tactics."
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "label": "He surrounded the Roman army",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "label": "He bribed the Roman consuls",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "It was battlefield tactics."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "His center fell back while his wings and cavalry closed around the Romans: a double envelopment.",
      "difficulty": 0.35
